# CQ-M3: Which ontological category does each theory assign to desire?
PREFIX odsr: <https://w3id.org/ontodesire#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?theory ?category
WHERE {
  ?t odsr:impliesCategory ?c .
  ?t rdfs:label ?theory . ?c rdfs:label ?category .
}
ORDER BY ?category ?theory
